codex
The pinned toolchain is present and matches Lean 4.22.0, but this sandbox exposes a host `/proc` while processes see namespace-local PIDs. Lean 4.22 reads `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`; that path is absent here, which explains both failures before any project code is read. I’m applying a minimal audited `LD_PRELOAD` shim that maps `getpid()` to `/proc/self`’s host PID solely so Lean can locate its own executable, then I’ll rerun the unchanged trusted preflight.
