Audit complete.

- Stage 3 classification: valid.
- Stage 4 deterministic generation: valid and target-preserving.
- Stage 5 Lean proof: invalid operational bridge. Its Float maximum implementation returns NaN when either operand is NaN, contrary to the frozen K semantics. A constant implementation also proves the theorem, confirming the target fails to enforce operational meaning.
- Final verdict: `FAIL / NOT_LEGIT`.

Full report: [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)  
